{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_11212270","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11212270","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1121227001:0":{"text":"先生に呼ばれて迎えに来た。ラミアの手紙を読んで、ずっと心配されていたそうだ。","source_cn":"雅顿贤者看了蕾米雅的信后放心不下，于是叫上了我来接你们。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD4822F1A361E647F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1121227002:1":{"text":"確かにアローラとそっくりじゃな。","source_cn":"她的确和阿露拉那孩子长得一模一样。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAD20770CB8309E09","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1121227003:1":{"text":"アローラは<style=\"highlight\">リウビア</style>という一族の出身でな、何年も前にバドーゾで隠居していた時に知り合ったんじゃよ。","source_cn":"阿露拉属于<style=highlight>告雨</s...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCC732F068874A1C7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1121227004:1":{"text":"たしか、自然環境の変化にとても敏感な一族ですよね。","source_cn":"我听说过，那一族对自然环境的变化尤为敏锐。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2A6AFD1969F68450","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1121227005:1":{"text":"そうじゃ。彼らの族長は早くから腐敗がユグドラシルとバドーゾ山脈に厄災をもたらすと予言していた。","source_cn":"没错，他们的族长甚至早就预知到了腐化会为薄暮丛林和瓦度...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4223C78DE6779602","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1121227006:0":{"text":"アルファⅪも埠頭で大雨が降ることを言い当てました！アルドン様、やはりこの子がアローラさん本人なのでしょうか？","source_cn":"阿尔法十一在港口预知了暴雨将至！雅顿贤者，她果然就是阿...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7DB20ADA3754BDD0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1121227007:0":{"text":"はてさて……外見は確かに似ているが、どうも雰囲気が違う気がするのう。","source_cn":"是不是呢……虽然外貌很像，但是她们给我的感觉并不相同。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF6B20A33D74AC975","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1121227008:0":{"text":"アルドン様、この子をリウビアの人たちに会わせたいと思うのですが。","source_cn":"雅顿贤者，我打算直接带阿尔法十一去找她的族人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCAC25E44FE930C9D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1121227009:1":{"text":"そう簡単には会えんぞ……彼らは居場所も不特定で、外界と交流することはめったにないからの。","source_cn":"你能顺利找到吗？告雨一族他们向来行踪不定，很少与外族联系。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE5530DE38D24B92","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1121227010:1":{"text":"じゃが、彼らはおそらくバドーゾ山脈の中部地方にいるじゃろう。あそこには人目につかん洞窟がたくさんあるからな。","source_cn":"但我可以告诉你的是，他们居住在瓦度索山脉的中部地区，那...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3008A268C24E7A96","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1121227011:0":{"text":"任せてください、私、かくれんぼや人探しは大の得意なんです。","source_cn":"没问题，找人嘛，我擅长。我最喜欢玩躲猫猫的游戏了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0F0E0FFC4C0F2E75","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1121227012:0":{"text":"バドーゾ、懐かしい名前……行ったことなんて、ないはずなのに。","source_cn":"瓦度索，很熟悉的地方……可我明明没去过。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFB5DF95B2A9D80AC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1121227013:0":{"text":"アローラ……もしかして、アタシは本当にアローラなの……？","source_cn":"阿露拉……难道，我真的是阿露拉……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8CAAFEE2FE4FC0B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:布莱恩":{"text":"ブライアン","source":"布莱恩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:雅顿":{"text":"アルドン","source":"雅顿","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:莱卡":{"text":"ライカ","source":"莱卡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:蕾米雅":{"text":"ラミア","source":"蕾米雅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:阿尔法十一":{"text":"アルファⅪ","source":"阿尔法十一","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":14,"localized_text_count":13,"speaker_count":5}}